PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
x_p9000:  An accelerated server for cards using the P9000 chipset.
x_p9000:
x_p9000:  Some of the cards this server will work with are the Diamond Viper
x_p9000:  VLB, Diamond Viper PCI, Orchid P9000 (and some other clones, such as
x_p9000:  the STAR 2000).  Viper Pro and other P9100 and P9130 cards are NOT
x_p9000:  supported yet.  Installing this package will create a link in
x_p9000:  /usr/X11/bin from XF86_P9000 to X, setting this server as the
x_p9000:  default.
